<h2 class="hm-title">Your Journey Through the Ecosystem</h2>
<p class="hm-lede">Each engagement is bespoke. The steps below describe the arc of the work — the pace and sequencing are always tailored to you.</p>
</header>
<div class="hm-path">
<div aria-hidden="true" class="hm-rail"><span class="hm-rail-fill"/><span class="hm-rail-bead"/></div>
<ol class="hm-steps">
<li class="hm-st">
<span aria-hidden="true" class="hm-st-node">1</span>
<div class="hm-st-card hm-rv hm-rv-l">
<span class="hm-st-k"><i aria-hidden="true" class="fa-solid fa-compass"/> Step 1</span>
<h3>Discovery</h3>
<p>A free 30-minute consultation to map your current situation, identify where you are carrying the most load, and determine the highest-leverage pillar to begin with. This is not a sales call — it is a genuine diagnostic conversation. We design your bespoke programme together, based on where you are right now.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="hm-st">
<span aria-hidden="true" class="hm-st-node">2</span>
<div class="hm-st-card hm-rv hm-rv-r">
<span class="hm-st-k"><i aria-hidden="true" class="fa-solid fa-seedling"/> Step 2</span>
<h3>Foundation Work</h3>
<p>We begin with the pillar most immediately relevant to your current situation — often The Tactical Mind or The Somatic Vessel — to establish the physiological and cognitive baseline that makes deeper work possible. Most clients notice meaningful shifts within the first few sessions.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="hm-st">
<span aria-hidden="true" class="hm-st-node">3</span>
<div class="hm-st-card hm-rv hm-rv-l">
<span class="hm-st-k"><i aria-hidden="true" class="fa-solid fa-circle-nodes"/> Step 3</span>
<h3>Pillar Integration</h3>
<p>As the foundation stabilises, we introduce additional pillars at the right pace. Each builds on the last. The system compounds: somatic work deepens once the mind is clearer; energetic work lands more fully once the body is regulated. The integration phase is where most clients experience the greatest acceleration.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="hm-st">
<span aria-hidden="true" class="hm-st-node">4</span>
<div class="hm-st-card hm-rv hm-rv-r">
<span class="hm-st-k"><i aria-hidden="true" class="fa-solid fa-infinity"/> Step 4</span>
<h3>Sustained Transformation</h3>
<p>Ongoing support for leaders committed to sustaining peak performance across every dimension. Many clients engage across all four pillars over 12–18 months, returning to the ecosystem at pivotal career moments — transitions, expansions, periods of high intensity or deep renewal.</p>
</div>
</li>
</ol>
