<h2 class="hm-title hm-rv">An Ecosystem That Requires a Rare Range</h2>
<div aria-hidden="true" class="hm-rule hm-rv"/>
<p class="hm-rv">Very few practitioners can credibly hold all four pillars. Each demands deep specialist training, supervised practice and lived fluency — not a weekend certification. Isabelle holds credentials spanning executive coaching (ICF PCC), somatic bodywork (Strozzi Institute), TRE™ (Global Certifying Trainer), Reiki (Usui/Holy Fire III Master Teacher), breathwork, NLP, mindfulness and core shamanism.</p>
<p class="hm-rv">This breadth is not accidental — it is the result of 25+ years of disciplined study, practice and client work across nine countries and forty nationalities. It is what makes the ecosystem coherent, and why the four pillars function as an integrated system rather than a loose collection of modalities.</p>
